{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OH NO!<br>Looks like you have had an accident when helping out with the new teleporter prototype and now you are only a few inches tall!<br>Let's hope nobody will take advantage of your current situation!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Tiny Treats!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The vore-themed first-person action stealth game!<br>Run and duck from cover to cover as you try to find all the parts required to become regular-sized again!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104420/extras/0e80adfefe75dc946b2132ab10e27fcf.webp?t=1762511035\" width=320 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt;First-person stealth-focused gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt;6 playable levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt;Interactive tutorial</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt;Many items with many uses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt;Metroidvania-style progression system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt;Secrets and collectables to find</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104420/extras/719f0be72f5a876ef81bd3ffd8125322.webp?t=1762511035\" width=320 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many varied levels to explore from your tiny point of view in a non-linear fashion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore laboratories, apartments and ventilation ducts in your search for the pieces of the teleportation device, all while trying your best to not be found by their inhabitants... or else...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104420/extras/286acc6829669673542c5c3d7179d9e1.webp?t=1762511035\" width=320 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many vore and size-focused scenes ranging from oral vore to unbirth!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rude preds and friendly ones!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something to enjoy for everyone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104420/extras/ae17e75ddb5e508e8ceab7555c24aa6f.webp?t=1762511035\" width=320 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game DEMO has the tutorial level and two of the playable levels in it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I HIGHLY recommend trying the DEMO before buying the game to see if you can run it as the game requires your GPU to be able to work with Vulkan shaders. (also to check if you like the game)</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4104420?t=1762511035","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4104420?t=1762511035","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104420/6d80fd0dcbe3440c7d0b695c8e8a55314e8cec33/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762511035","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104420/6d80fd0dcbe3440c7d0b695c8e8a55314e8cec33/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762511035","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"descript